{
  "build": "vt-nh",
  "note": "Known answers for a Vermont-plus-New-Hampshire build. Two of them ask for the state in the label, because that is what a multi-state build has to get right: Burlington is Vermont's and Concord is New Hampshire's, and a build that labelled either with the other's state would be wrong in a way a bare name check would not notice. The coordinates are the two city centres.",
  "cases": [
